<title>SINGAPORE: Comfort, Vicom MD quits.</title>
<headline>Comfort, Vicom MD quits.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sam Chong Keen is to resign as managing director of transport and taxi group Comfort Group Ltd at the end of February, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company gave no reason for the departure, effective from February 28, and said in a statement it had begun the search for a replacement.</p>
<p>The company said Sam had played a pivotal role in building the group from mainly a taxi-based firm into a diversified land transport business.</p>
<p>A separate statement from related vehicle inspection company Vicom, said Sam had also resigned as its managing director with effect from the same date.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
